{"type":"message","id":"2c916853","parentId":"271e306d","timestamp":"2026-04-03T00:00:16.158Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"jq 문법에 문제가 있군요. `stargazers_count`는 GitHub API 응답에 존재하는 필드인데 jq에서 접근 방식이 다릅니다. 다시 시도해보겠습니다.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8593d36375a44bea939f37cb","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh api \"search/repositories?q=created:>2026-03-27&sort=stars&order=desc&per_page=5\" --jq '.items[] | {name, full_name, description, stargazers_count, html_url}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":24,"output":170,"cacheRead":21002,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21196,"cost":{"input":0.0000144,"output":0.00037400000000000004,"cacheRead":0.00231022,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00269862}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775174413782,"responseId":"20260403080014a0ff18ad7f7542c1"}}
{"type":"message","id":"b1722425","parentId":"2c916853","timestamp":"2026-04-03T00:00:16.695Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_8593d36375a44bea939f37cb","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"description\":\"[Notice] The repo temporarily locked while ownership transfer. in the meantime we maintain on here: https://github.com/ultraworkers/claw-code-parity. The fastest repo in history to surpass 100K stars ⭐. Better Harness Tools that make real things done. Built in Rust using oh-my-codex.\",\"full_name\":\"ultraworkers/claw-code\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/ultraworkers/claw-code\",\"name\":\"claw-code\",\"stargazers_count\":149838}\n{\"description\":\"Research on Coding Agents\",\"full_name\":\"sanbuphy/learn-coding-agent\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/sanbuphy/learn-coding-agent\",\"name\":\"learn-coding-agent\",\"stargazers_count\":10999}\n{\"description\":\"Use Codex from Claude Code to review code or delegate tasks.\",\"full_name\":\"openai/codex-plugin-cc\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/openai/codex-plugin-cc\",\"name\":\"codex-plugin-cc\",\"stargazers_count\":10605}\n{\"description\":\"原汁原昧 Claude Code 可运行,可构建版; Typescript 类型全修复; 企业级可靠性; 安全无毒, lock 文件保真, 可直接 bun i; bun run dev 启动\",\"full_name\":\"claude-code-best/claude-code\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/claude-code-best/claude-code\",\"name\":\"claude-code\",\"stargazers_count\":10469}\n{\"description\":null,\"full_name\":\"ChinaSiro/claude-code-sourcemap\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/ChinaSiro/claude-code-sourcemap\",\"name\":\"claude-code-sourcemap\",\"stargazers_count\":7987}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":534,"aggregated":"{\"description\":\"[Notice] The repo temporarily locked while ownership transfer. in the meantime we maintain on here: https://github.com/ultraworkers/claw-code-parity. The fastest repo in history to surpass 100K stars ⭐. Better Harness Tools that make real things done. Built in Rust using oh-my-codex.\",\"full_name\":\"ultraworkers/claw-code\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/ultraworkers/claw-code\",\"name\":\"claw-code\",\"stargazers_count\":149838}\n{\"description\":\"Research on Coding Agents\",\"full_name\":\"sanbuphy/learn-coding-agent\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/sanbuphy/learn-coding-agent\",\"name\":\"learn-coding-agent\",\"stargazers_count\":10999}\n{\"description\":\"Use Codex from Claude Code to review code or delegate tasks.\",\"full_name\":\"openai/codex-plugin-cc\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/openai/codex-plugin-cc\",\"name\":\"codex-plugin-cc\",\"stargazers_count\":10605}\n{\"description\":\"原汁原昧 Claude Code 可运行,可构建版; Typescript 类型全修复; 企业级可靠性; 安全无毒, lock 文件保真, 可直接 bun i; bun run dev 启动\",\"full_name\":\"claude-code-best/claude-code\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/claude-code-best/claude-code\",\"name\":\"claude-code\",\"stargazers_count\":10469}\n{\"description\":null,\"full_name\":\"ChinaSiro/claude-code-sourcemap\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/ChinaSiro/claude-code-sourcemap\",\"name\":\"claude-code-sourcemap\",\"stargazers_count\":7987}","cwd":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775174416693}}
